<title>UK: Allied Props chair says to step down in 1998.</title>
<headline>Allied Props chair says to step down in 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of British property firm Allied London Properties, Sir Geoffrey Leigh, told shareholders on Thursday he intended to step down as an executive in two year's time following his 65th birthday.</p>
<p>&quot;The board have asked me to continue as non-executive chairman from that time and I am delighted to accept their invitation,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
